<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('./partials/head') %>
  <title>Privacy Policy — Blog App</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Read Blog App's Privacy Policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
</head>
<body class="bg-body-warm">
  <%- include('./partials/nav') %>
  <header class="py-5 py-lg-6 text-center border-bottom bg-white">
    <div class="container py-lg-3">
      <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 720px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-text d-inline-block mb-2">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="hero-headline mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-secondary fs-5 mb-0" style="line-height: 1.6;">
          We believe privacy is a right, not a feature. Here's exactly what we collect, why, and how you can control it.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted small mt-3 mb-0">
          <i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1"></i> Last updated: September 12, 2026 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
          <i class="bi bi-clock me-1"></i> ~6 min read
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main class="py-5 py-lg-6">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px;">
      <div class="editorial-card p-4 bg-white border shadow-sm mb-5 d-flex gap-3 align-items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
          <span class="badge bg-dark text-white rounded-2 px-2 py-1" style="font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">TL;DR</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="mb-0 small text-secondary" style="line-height: 1.7;">
            We collect your name, email, and profile info to run your account. We do <strong class="text-dark">not</strong> sell your data, run ads, or use third-party tracking pixels. We store only what's needed, secure it carefully, and you can delete your account and all data at any time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 1</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Who We Are</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <p>
              Blog App ("we", "us", "our") is an independent publishing platform where writers can create, publish, and share long-form content. We are committed to handling your personal information with transparency, care, and minimal collection.
            </p>
            <p>
              This Privacy Policy applies to all services operated under the <strong>Blog App</strong> brand, including our website, web application, and any related services.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0">
              If you have questions about this policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@blogapp.io" class="text-dark fw-semibold">privacy@blogapp.io</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 2</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">What Information We Collect</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Information You Provide</h3>
            <ul class="mb-4">
              <li><strong>Account Data</strong> — Your full name, email address, and a hashed password when you create an account.</li>
              <li><strong>Profile Data</strong> — An optional bio, location, website URL, and profile photo you choose to upload.</li>
              <li><strong>Content Data</strong> — Blog posts, drafts, comments, and any media files you upload to the platform.</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Information We Collect Automatically</h3>
            <ul class="mb-4">
              <li><strong>Session Cookie</strong> — An <code>httpOnly</code>, <code>sameSite: strict</code> JWT cookie is set upon login to authenticate your session. It expires after 2 days. No third-party cookies are used.</li>
              <li><strong>Server Logs</strong> — Standard request logs recording timestamps, HTTP methods, and status codes for operational purposes. These are not linked to your identity.</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">What We Do NOT Collect</h3>
            <ul class="mb-0">
              <li>We do <strong>not</strong> use advertising trackers, Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any third-party analytics.</li>
              <li>We do <strong>not</strong> collect device fingerprints, IP address logs tied to user identities, or browsing history.</li>
              <li>We do <strong>not</strong> use any form of behavioral profiling or interest-based targeting.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 3</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <p>We use collected information exclusively to:</p>
            <ul class="mb-0">
              <li>Create and manage your author account and authenticate your sessions.</li>
              <li>Display your public author profile, published stories, and bio to other readers.</li>
              <li>Associate your name with your published or draft posts.</li>
              <li>Send essential transactional emails (e.g., password reset) — never unsolicited marketing without explicit consent.</li>
              <li>Maintain the security and stability of the platform.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 4</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Data Sharing &amp; Third Parties</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <p><strong>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to any third party.</strong></p>
            <p>We may share data only in limited circumstances:</p>
            <ul class="mb-0">
              <li><strong>Legal Compliance</strong> — If required by law or court order. We will notify you where legally permitted.</li>
              <li><strong>Service Providers</strong> — Infrastructure providers (hosting, database) under strict data processing agreements who cannot use your data for their own purposes.</li>
              <li><strong>Business Transfer</strong> — In the event of a merger or acquisition, under the same privacy obligations.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 5</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Data Security</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including:</p>
            <ul class="mb-0">
              <li><strong>bcrypt password hashing</strong> (cost factor 10) — Passwords are never stored in plain text.</li>
              <li><strong>Signed JWT sessions</strong> — Authenticated with a secure secret key, 2-day expiry.</li>
              <li><strong>httpOnly + sameSite:strict cookies</strong> — Session tokens are inaccessible to JavaScript and protected against CSRF.</li>
              <li><strong>HTTP security headers</strong> — We use <code>helmet.js</code> for HSTS, X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options, and a strict Content Security Policy.</li>
              <li><strong>Input sanitization</strong> — All user-generated content is sanitized before rendering to prevent XSS attacks.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 6</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Your Rights &amp; Choices</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <p>You have the following rights over your personal data:</p>
            <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
              <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100" style="background: #f8f7f4;">
                  <div class="fw-bold text-dark small mb-1">Access</div>
                  <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Request a copy of all personal data we hold about you.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100" style="background: #f8f7f4;">
                  <div class="fw-bold text-dark small mb-1">Correction</div>
                  <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Update or correct your profile at any time via your account settings.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100" style="background: #f8f7f4;">
                  <div class="fw-bold text-dark small mb-1">Deletion</div>
                  <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Request permanent deletion of your account and all associated data.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100" style="background: #f8f7f4;">
                  <div class="fw-bold text-dark small mb-1">Portability</div>
                  <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Your blog posts are written in standard Markdown — always portable.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mb-0">
              To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:privacy@blogapp.io" class="text-dark fw-semibold">privacy@blogapp.io</a>. We respond within 30 days.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 7</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Cookies</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <p>We use exactly <strong>one</strong> cookie:</p>
            <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 mb-3" style="background: #f5f5f0; font-size: 0.9rem;">
              <strong>Name:</strong> <code>token</code><br>
              <strong>Purpose:</strong> User authentication session<br>
              <strong>Type:</strong> httpOnly, sameSite:strict, secure (in production)<br>
              <strong>Duration:</strong> 2 days (expires automatically)
            </div>
            <p class="mb-0">
              There are no advertising, social media tracking, or analytics cookies. You can clear this cookie at any time by logging out.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white border">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Section 8</span>
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <div class="article-markdown" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3139;">
            <p class="mb-0">
              If we make material changes to this Privacy Policy, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page and, where appropriate, notify you by email. Continued use of the platform after such changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="editorial-card p-5 text-center bg-dark text-white rounded-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 560px;">
          <h2 class="h3 font-serif mb-3 text-white">Questions about your data?</h2>
          <p class="text-white-50 mb-4">Our privacy team responds to all requests within 30 days.</p>
          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
            <a href="mailto:privacy@blogapp.io" class="btn btn-light fw-semibold px-4 py-2">
              <i class="bi bi-envelope me-1"></i> Contact Privacy Team
            </a>
            <a href="/terms" class="btn btn-outline-light px-4 py-2">Read Terms of Service</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer py-5 border-top bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
          <span class="fw-bold font-serif text-dark fs-5">Blog App</span>
          <span class="text-muted small ms-2">© 2026 Blog App Inc.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-4 small flex-wrap justify-content-center">
          <a href="/" class="footer-link">Home</a>
          <a href="/features" class="footer-link">Features</a>
          <a href="/pricing" class="footer-link">Pricing</a>
          <a href="/about" class="footer-link">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy" class="footer-link fw-bold text-dark">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/terms" class="footer-link">Terms</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <%- include('./partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
